{"id":"28999e0c83253377","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md","title":"Compact Operator","display":"df-compact-operator — Compact Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-compact-operator","aliases":["58-df-compact-operator","58-df-zfc-ana-compact-operator"],"display":"df-compact-operator — Compact Operator","depends_on":["[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","[[../batch10/58-df-precompact.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-compact-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-compact-operator</span><span>58-df-zfc-ana-compact-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compact-operator — Compact Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec17b877f67b9c76\" href=\"?note=ec17b877f67b9c76\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-precompact.md\">../batch10/58-df-precompact.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,X,Y,d_Y,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V\">\\(T,X,Y,d_Y,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_Y:Y\\times Y\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(d_Y:Y\\times Y\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Precompact}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Precompact}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec17b877f67b9c76\" href=\"?note=ec17b877f67b9c76\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-precompact.md\">../batch10/58-df-precompact.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span> (fully explicit predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (existential compatibility predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaCompactOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaCompactOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}operator\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y,d_Y;\\mathbb F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F)\\land\\forall y,z\\in Y\\;\\bigl(d_Y(y,z)=\\|y+_Y((-1)\\odot_Yz)\\|_Y\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Precompact}_S\\!\\left(T\\!\\left[\\{x\\in X:\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}\\right],Y,d_Y\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}operator\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y,d_Y;\\mathbb F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F)\\land\\forall y,z\\in Y\\;\\bigl(d_Y(y,z)=\\|y+_Y((-1)\\odot_Yz)\\|_Y\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Precompact}_S\\!\\left(T\\!\\left[\\{x\\in X:\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}\\right],Y,d_Y\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,d_Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y,d_Y;\\mathbb F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,d_Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y,d_Y;\\mathbb F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaCompactOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaCompactOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The explicit predicate binds the same norm and vector-space witnesses used for boundedness to the norm-induced metric used for precompactness.</li>\n<li>Equivalently, every bounded sequence in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> has a subsequence whose image under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> converges in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Every linear map between finite-dimensional normed spaces is compact; in infinite dimensions compactness is much stronger than boundedness.</li>\n<li>The metric used for precompactness is explicitly the metric induced by the same norm and addition occurring in the bounded-operator witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-precompact.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec17b877f67b9c76","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-precompact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}$ (see [[58-df-bounded-operator]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-precompact.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec17b877f67b9c76","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Precompact}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-precompact.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T,X,Y,d_Y,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"d_Y:Y\\times Y\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Precompact}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{11}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaCompactOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}operator\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y,d_Y;\\mathbb F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y;\\mathbb F)\\land\\forall y,z\\in Y\\;\\bigl(d_Y(y,z)=\\|y+_Y((-1)\\odot_Yz)\\|_Y\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Precompact}_S\\!\\left(T\\!\\left[\\{x\\in X:\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}\\right],Y,d_Y\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathbb F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,d_Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S(T;X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_X,\\odot_X;Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_Y,\\odot_Y,d_Y;\\mathbb F)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaCompactOperator}_S(T,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,X,Y)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":2391,"backlinks":[{"id":"7da7ff11e397ca55","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-compact-operator]])"},{"id":"cb6f3da63e39a685","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,H,H)$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md]])"},{"id":"e824a8435bba9f97","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"198327ce38a3b80d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompactOperatorStructure}_S$ (fully explicit compact-operator predicate, see [[58-df-compact-operator]])"},{"id":"59e53f2a0f1b0898","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md|58-df-compact-operator]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["2ad9c248fe18df37","ec17b877f67b9c76"]}